[b]CSS v1.0.0-beta.11[/b]

[list]
[*]Genessa's Faithful and Stray doubles can copy your current appearance and supported customization while keeping their ghost effects.
[*]Added separate Default / Use CSS choices for both doubles in MISC.
[*]Added Genessa Form in MISC to switch once between Faithful and Stray. Later transitions follow the game.
[*]Profiles remember your doubles choices.
[/list]

Tested with Unholy Genessa, Eve and Commander White. Other shells and NPC/enemy looks have partial support and may show visual or animation issues. Unsupported appearances use the original Genessa double.

Install the separate [b]CSS Astral Shared Assets[/b] download for customized doubles. Your gameplay shell must be Genessa.

